name    puzzle
prog    /dd/CMDS/GAMES/puzzle
# Generic: does it draw, and does the screen change when keys arrive?
rate    0.7
wait    5
snap    opening
wait 3
wait    2
snap    played
key     \003
wait    2
# CANNOT PASS AND SHOULD NOT: DOC/INDEX describes this as the "sliding-tile
# puzzle for G-Windows".  It draws through a graphics windowing system that
# does not exist here, so it writes nothing to a terminal -- the same
# situation as the Graph family.  CMDS/puzzle15 and GAMES/puz15 are ordinary
# terminal 15-puzzles and both play; use those.  Kept so this stays recorded
# rather than being rediscovered as a "broken program" every few months.
